VALUES (NULL, NULL, 101320, 'Bum Simulator', 'Bum Simulator', 'game', 2023, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2m6r.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arklq.jpg', 'You lost everything and ended up on the streets. What will you do? Adapt and survive? Take revenge on those responsible? Become an urban legend?

Bum Simulator is a sandbox game bursting with inappropriate humor and memorable characters. Apart from day-to-day survival, you can enjoy many unique features.

You can throw pigeons at people and watch as the panic ensues. Not fun enough? Upgrade your birds with explosives and let chaos reign. Still not satisfied? Wait until you see the fully upgraded pigeonado skill…', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/bum-simulator', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 6.2, 0, 9.07, '2026-11-27 20:45:57', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
