VALUES (NULL, NULL, 2993, 'The Wolf Among Us', 'The Wolf Among Us', 'game', 2013, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1rcy.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar698.jpg', 'The Wolf Among Us is a five-episode series from the creators of the 2012 Game of the Year: The Walking Dead. Based on Fables (DC Comics/Vertigo), an award-winning comic book series, it is an often violent, mature and hard-boiled thriller where the characters and creatures of myth, lore and legend are real and exist in our world. As Bigby Wolf - The Big Bad Wolf in human form - you will discover that the brutal, bloody murder of a Fable is just a taste of things to come, in a game series where your every decision can have enormous consequences.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/the-wolf-among-us', '["PlayStation 3", "PlayStation 4", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "Mac", "PlayStation Vita", "Xbox 360", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 8.1, 0, 10.025, '2026-11-27 20:45:57', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
