VALUES (NULL, NULL, 57676, 'Outwars', 'Outwars', 'game', 1998, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2y53.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arnkt.jpg', 'Outwars is a science fiction third-person shooter developed by SingleTrac and published by Microsoft in 1998.

The game also features an 8-player multiplayer mode allowing players to compete with and against one another in the modes: Free for All, Assassin, Smear the cyborg, Team War, Team Mission, and Capture the flag.

A rather unusual feature of Outwars is that the legs and the torso can be controlled separately. This extra function can however be disabled by reconfiguring the controls.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/outwars', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 9.03, '2026-11-27 20:45:57', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
