VALUES (NULL, NULL, 325, 'Hellgate: London', 'Hellgate: London', 'game', 2007, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co218m.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2430.jpg', 'Hellgate: London combines the depth of role-playing games and action of first-person titles, while offering infinite playability with randomly created levels, items and events. The player creates a heroic character, completes quests and battles through innumerable hordes of demons to advance through experience levels and branching skill paths. A robust, flexible skill and spell system, highly customizable appearances and a massive variety of randomly generated equipment allow players to create their own unique hero.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/hellgate-london', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 7.5, 0, 8.04, '2026-11-27 20:45:57', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
