VALUES (NULL, NULL, 17252, 'The Culling', 'The Culling', 'game', 2017, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rky.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar76h.jpg', 'In a remote island paradise, 16 contestants have 20 minutes to explore, scavenge items, craft weapons, build traps, and hunt and kill each other. Only one will be crowned the winner. Do you have the guts to survive? Prepare for the most focused, brutal, and adrenaline-filled battle royale game you''ve ever seen!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/the-culling', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 3.5, 0, 10.05, '2026-11-27 20:45:57', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
