VALUES (NULL, NULL, 136977, 'GigaBash', 'GigaBash', 'game', 2022, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8ypt.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar624t.jpg', 'GigaBash is a 4 player arena brawler, play from a colorful cast of characters inspired by classic monster tropes, each with their own unique skillset. Rampage around the world in familiar battlegrounds, such as cities & jungles, each with a unique mechanic designed. Transform into an S-class Titan for an epic comeback, or dominate your foes in style with your Ultimate. The game emphasizes on accessibility & pure fun, seeking to unite players on the couch for a casual bash or a competitive brawl.
About th', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/gigabash', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 7.0, 0, 10.01, '2026-11-27 20:45:57', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
