VALUES (NULL, NULL, 113108, 'Journey to the Savage Planet', 'Journey to the Savage Planet', 'game', 2020, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pkf.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar64f.jpg', 'Onward To Adventure
In this colorful, co-op adventure game you play as the newest recruit to Kindred Aerospace. Dropped onto an uncharted planet with little equipment, you must determine if this planet is fit for human habitation but perhaps you are not the first to set foot here…', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/journey-to-the-savage-planet', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 7.6, 0, 1.02, '2026-11-27 20:45:57', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
