VALUES (NULL, NULL, 215835, 'Warlander', 'Warlander', 'game', 2023, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co56ev.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar1u14.jpg', 'Warlander is an action-packed, third-person, online-multiplayer game, with a unique style that mashes a Medieval-inspired setting, Fantastical items and abilities…and…even powerful robots!

Featuring intense competitive skirmishes and epic castle siege warfare with up to 100 players, you must use the almighty powers of god-like Warriors, Clerics, and Mages, as well as siege weapons and cataclysmic spells to control the battlefield.

To be victorious, you must work as a team, defend your Keep, and tactically break into the enemy’s stronghold to destroy their core!

Service for Warlander ended on January 20, 2026 at 09:00 UTC. The game is no longer playable.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/warlander--1', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 1.09, '2026-11-27 20:45:57', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
