The graphics will dazzle you, the speed will astound you... but if you don''t think fast and shoot faster, you won''t have a chance against the alien firestorm. Because in EARTH DEFENSE FORCE, the best defense is always a great offense.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/earth-defense-force', '["Arcade"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 5.02999999999999936e+00, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
