VALUES (NULL, NULL, 17279, 'Angels Fall First', 'Angels Fall First', 'game', 2026, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/coce2x.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar698m.jpg', 'Angels Fall First is a first person combined-arms sci-fi wargame.
From commanding the battle standing on the bridge of your flagship all the way down to frantic infantry firefights - AFF brings together all the combat you ever wanted.
Featuring tactical team-oriented gameplay and offering a wide selection of weapons, tools, vehicles and spacecraft, AFF focuses on objective-based scenarios with a high degree of replayability, playable both online and offline.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/angels-fall-first', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 8.0, 0, 6.585, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
