VALUES (NULL, NULL, 26481, 'Ravenfield', 'Ravenfield', 'game', 2017, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co24pg.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arklv.jpg', 'Ravenfield is a singleplayer battlefield style game. It started out as an experiment with ragdolls and AI, and will remain a slightly experimental, for-fun game project.

Walk upon the Ravenfield with your BLUE allies! Take down those pesky REDs using helicopters, cars, guns, and active ragdoll physics.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/ravenfield', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 7.0, 0, 9.53, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-27 20:45:57')
